RainbowBarrels is an unofficial Darktide mod and is not affiliated with
Fatshark or Games Workshop. Warhammer 40,000 and Darktide and their game
resources belong to their respective rights holders.

The standalone release contains two modified Darktide resource bundles and
1,098 custom material streams. It does not alter game files on disk or
include the game decoder, game executable, Darktide Mod Loader, Darktide Mod
Framework, or LuaExec.

Asset Redirect v2 (`asset_redirect.lua` and `asset-redirect.dll`) is sourced
from Wobin's Polychromatic 1.0.1 project:
https://github.com/Wobin/Polychromatic . These third-party components remain
the work of their respective authors and are not covered by RainbowBarrels'
license.
